#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:7
#: 3a6b476787734ec9bdd48e23b3516e02
msgid ""
"This article explains where to get the ArduPilot code and how to submit "
"changes to the project."
msgstr "本文介绍从哪里获取 ArduPilot 代码以及如何向项目提交更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:11
#: 791a9cb8c1a44388b1f8a44d841cd037
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:13
#: 610d849481ce4f7880e16758d25c9708
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot project uses `git <http://git-scm.com/>`__ for source code "
"management and `GitHub <https://github.com/>`__ for source code hosting."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 项目使用 `git <http://git-scm.com/>`__ 进行源代码管理，并使用 `GitHub "
"<https://github.com/>`__ 托管源代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:16
#: 18352b79276e4027a7815738408a07c2
msgid ""
"For developers who simply want to take a quick look at the code, the source "
"code for Plane, Copter, Rover, Sub and Antenna Tracker can be viewed with "
"any web browser by going to the `ArduPilot repo on Github "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于只想快速查看代码的开发者，可以通过任何网页浏览器访问 `GitHub 上的 ArduPilot 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ 来查看 Plane、Copter、Rover、Sub "
"和天线追踪器的源代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:20
#: 3b6e626512014ec2a233ea923f8d11ce
msgid "For developers who wish to **download** and **build** the latest code:"
msgstr "对于希望 **下载** 和 **构建** 最新代码的开发者："

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:22
#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:32
#: 81ae3d617d3d44399e95bffc0b0e8769 f87780738976415192788946732b89c4
msgid ":ref:`install a git client <git-install>` on your local computer"
msgstr "在本地计算机上 :ref:`安装 git 客户端 <git-install>`"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:23
#: 948035304b33453daeff5e761d7efc3f
msgid "\"clone\" the project to download \"master\" to your local computer"
msgstr "「克隆」项目以将「master」下载到本地计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:24
#: a19f6f20b5b44b7db63591ccfc76692a
msgid ""
":ref:`build/compile the firmware <building-the-code>` using waf or make"
msgstr "使用 waf 或 make :ref:`构建/编译固件 <building-the-code>`"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:26
#: 46b0be282a2a4c5f9c704d9b2a4c0b49
msgid ""
"Note that the latest firmware is built automatically and can be directly "
"downloaded from `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"请注意，最新固件已自动构建，可直接从 `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:28
#: 68aeb90145c2412199e9d9cd8e451b3b
msgid ""
"For developers who wish to **download**, **compile**, **edit** and then "
"**contribute** code back to ArduPilot, the following steps should be "
"followed:"
msgstr "对于希望 **下载**、**编译**、**编辑** 并 **贡献** 代码回 ArduPilot 的开发者，应按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:31
#: eb9aa541277242829a000f8b0246d319
msgid ":ref:`fork <git-fork>` the project to create a personal copy on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上 :ref:`fork <git-fork>` 项目以创建个人副本"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:33
#: d2f72773ed804d4297999d4f678f2f6d
msgid "\"clone\" the project to download this copy to a local desktop computer"
msgstr "「克隆」项目以将此副本下载到本地桌面计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:34
#: 9644b735775548188c53c88ed6090216
msgid "create a new branch on their local desktop to  hold the new feature"
msgstr "在本地桌面创建一个新分支以存放新功能"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:35
#: ad2ea39e3246426baf27cab7d0bde3d3
msgid "edit the code and \"commit\" it to the local repo."
msgstr "编辑代码并将其「提交」到本地仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:36
#: a24b994038d341aa9557eae4fb80a470
msgid "\"push\" the new branch up to the personal repo (i.e. their fork)"
msgstr "将新分支「push」到个人仓库（即他们的 fork）"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:37
#: 17d719c26f8c484d8e7bbd9cff222c30
msgid ""
"raise a pull request to get the changes merged into the \"master\" project."
msgstr "提交 PR 以将更改合并到「master」项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:42
#: 5afa90ef72e74242b21cc7c6cc6b7846
msgid "Learning git"
msgstr "学习 git"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:44
#: 688a646e87a54508a1b02ab3b0bd4eaf
msgid ""
"This guide covers the basic git commands/concepts needed to work with the "
"project: clone, branch, commit, push."
msgstr "本指南涵盖了与项目协作所需的基本 git 命令/概念：clone、branch、commit、push。"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:47
#: adfe5ebbfbca4ca6b09ed9aaee2add45
msgid ""
"If you want to know more about git there are many great resources online. "
"Here are just a few you may find useful:"
msgstr "如果您想了解更多关于 git 的知识，网上有很多优秀资源。以下是您可能会觉得有用的几个："

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:50
