msgid ""
"`Try Git <http://try.github.io/levels/1/challenges/1>`__: browser-based "
"interactive tutorial for learning git"
msgstr ""
"`Try Git <http://try.github.io/levels/1/challenges/1>`__：基于浏览器的 git 交互式学习教程"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:52
#: eba1b0c8b7a747f8bbcaa4a147b6d944
msgid ""
"`Git Ready <http://gitready.com/>`__: tutorials of varying difficulty levels"
msgstr "`Git Ready <http://gitready.com/>`__：不同难度级别的教程"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:54
#: 01bd9e1bef504c5b8fba5a7cf766f929
msgid ""
"`Git SCM Book <http://git-scm.com/book/en/Getting-Started>`__: introduction "
"and full documentation"
msgstr ""
"`Git SCM Book <http://git-scm.com/book/en/Getting-Started>`__：入门介绍和完整文档"

#: ../../source/docs/where-to-get-the-code.rst:56
#: 1e3f2d2d0c8849c4b7cb70774ca10eb8
msgid ""
"`Git Flight Rules <https://github.com/k88hudson/git-flight-"
"rules/blob/master/README.md>`__: a guide for what to do when things go wrong"
msgstr ""
"`Git 飞行规则 <https://github.com/k88hudson/git-flight-"
"rules/blob/master/README.md>`__：出问题时该怎么做的指南"

